Package: easy-connection
Version: 0.1.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 0
Depends: nftables, iproute2, openssl, systemd, libc6 (>= 2.39), libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, librsvg2-2, polkitd, pkexec
Recommends: systemd-resolved, hicolor-icon-theme, desktop-file-utils
Maintainer: Easy Connection Contributors <easy@localhost>
Description: Easy Connection desktop client for Ubuntu
 Native GUI and CLI for SSH, Shadowsocks, and VLESS tunnels with
 local SOCKS/HTTP proxies and optional system-wide TCP intercept.
 .
 Installs the Easy Connection app menu entry, the "easy" command,
 the easy-helper background service, and a polkit policy so Connect
 can elevate the helper via pkexec when needed.
